#[doc = "Sandwich product: [`Dipole`] x [`Plane`] x rev([`Dipole`]).\n\nThe sandwich product `v x a x rev(v)` applies the transformation\nrepresented by the versor `v` to the operand `a`. For rotors, this\nperforms rotation; for motors, it performs rigid body transformation."]
