#[doc = "Antisandwich product: [`Sphere`] x [`Plane`] x antirev([`Sphere`]).\n\nThe antisandwich product `v x a x antirev(v)` is the dual of the\nsandwich product, used in Projective GA for transforming dual objects\n(planes, ideal points). Motors use antisandwich for plane transforms."]
